cn":"我这边听不清。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်က သေချာမကြားရဘူး။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"你声音有点小。","meaning_my":"အသံ နည်းနည်းတိုးနေတယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我说大声一点。","meaning_my":"အသံ နည်းနည်း ပိုကျယ်ကျယ် ပြောမယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"能大点声吗？","meaning_my":"အသံ နည်းနည်းကျယ်ကျယ် ပြောပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"你说慢一点。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း ဖြည်းဖြည်း ပြောပေးပါ။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"声音断断续续的。","meaning_my":"အသံက ပြတ်တောင်းပြတ်တောင်း ဖြစ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那我换个地方再打。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို တခြားနေရာ ပြောင်းပြီး ပြန်ဆက်မယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"我这边信号不好。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက် ဖုန်းလိုင်း မကောင်းဘူး။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"你那边太吵了。","meaning_my":"ဟိုဘက်က အသံ အရမ်းဆူနေတယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"等一下，我换个地方。","meaning_my":"ခဏလေး၊ တခြားနေရာ ပြောင်းလိုက်ဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"电话断了。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းလိုင်း ပြတ်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S017_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"刚才断线了。","meaning_my":"ခုနက ဖုန်းလိုင်း ပြတ်သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S017_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"我挂了，再打给你。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းအရင်ချလိုက်မယ်၊ ပြီးမှ ပြန်ဆက်မယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"你先别挂，我查一下。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းမချနဲ့ဦး၊ ခဏ စစ်ကြည့်မယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"你打错电话了吧？","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းနံပါတ် မှားဆက်မိတာလား။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不好意思，我打错了。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ ဖုန်းမှားဆက်မိတာပါ။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"刚才说到哪儿了？","meaning_my":"ခုနက ဘယ်အကြောင်းအထိ ပြောခဲ့တာလဲ။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"刚说到明天几点见。","meaning_my":"ခုနက မနက်ဖြန် ဘယ်နှနာရီတွေ့မလဲဆိုတာ ပြောနေတာ။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"电话一直打不通。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းဆက်တာ တောက်လျှောက် မဝင်ဘူး။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可能对方关机了。","meaning_my":"တစ်ဖက်က ဖုန်းပိတ်ထားလို့ ဖြစ်နိုင်တယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S022_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦让他回个电话。","meaning_my":"သူ့ကို ဖုန်းပြန်ဆက်ပေးဖို့ ပြောပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，我转告他。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ သူ့ကို ပြောပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S024","kind":"main","cn":"我们可以视频通话吗？","meaning_my":"ဗီဒီယိုကောလ် ပြောလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.02.03-S025","kind":"main","cn":"没别的事，先这样。","meaning_my":"တခြားကိစ္စ မရှိတော့ဘူး၊ ဒီလောက်ပဲနော်။","audio_file":"07.02.03-S025.mp3",